rt.equal(distFreshness.preparePackageBuild('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'prepared');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:343:  assert.equal(distFreshness.recordPackageBuild('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'recorded');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:347:  assert.equal(distFreshness.checkPackageFreshness('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'stale');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/README.md:51:| `system-skill-advisor.test.cjs` | `system-skill-advisor.js` | Advisor caching, lifecycle, and bridge behavior, with the bridge imported via `pathToFileURL`. |\n.opencode/plugins/tests/README.md:56:| `v2-hard-plugins.test.cjs` | `system-completion-sentinel.js`, `system-spec-gate.js`, `system-skill-advisor.js`, `opencode-goal.js` | Selected hard cases, not the plugin list (that comes from `helpers/plugin-inventory.cjs`). Registration plus behavior cases on a stub v2 context: completion advisory logging, a denied write through `execute.before`, goal continuation queued through `session.prompt`, goal evidence and token usage from session events, plus advisor transform dedup cleared after compaction. |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs\n.opencode/plugins/README.md\n.opencode/plugins/lib/skill-advisor-render.js\n.opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\n.skilled/hooks/dispatch/pi/dispatch-preflight-lint.ts\n.skilled/hooks/dispatch/pi/dispatch-preflight-lint.test.ts\n.skilled/hooks/dispatch/pi/directive-dedup.test.ts\n.skilled/hooks/coverage-rationale.md\n.skilled/hooks/injection-contract.md\n.skilled/hooks/skill-advisor/dsh/README.md\n---\n.opencode/plugins/ARCHITECTURE.md:79:├── system-skill-advisor.js\n.opencode/plugins/ARCHITECTURE.md:88:│   ├── skill-advisor-render.js\n.opencode/plugins/ARCHITECTURE.md:228:- OpenCode 2.0.32 does not deliver `server.instance.disposed` or `global.disposed` to plugins; it sends `location.shutdown` and runs the cleanup the bridge returns. The disposal branches in `system-skill-advisor.js` and `system-dist-freshness-guard.js` therefore run only on OpenCode 1 (observed 2026-10-20, listed in `tests/plugin-inventory.json`).\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:329:    'system-skill-advisor',\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:335:  assert.equal(distFreshness.packageForSourceFile(jsonPath, { workspaceRoot: tmpDir }).id, 'system-skill-advisor/runtime');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:342:  assert.equal(distFreshness.preparePackageBuild('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'prepared');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:343:  assert.equal(distFreshness.recordPackageBuild('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'recorded');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/system-dist-freshness-guard.test.cjs:347:  assert.equal(distFreshness.checkPackageFreshness('system-skill-advisor/runtime', options).status, 'stale');\n.opencode/plugins/tests/README.md:51:| `system-skill-advisor.test.cjs` | `system-skill-advisor.js` | Advisor caching, lifecycle, and bridge behavior, with the bridge imported via `pathToFileURL`. |\n.opencode/plugins/tests/README.md:56:| `v2-hard-plugins.test.cjs` | `system-completion-sentinel.js`, `system-spec-gate.js`, `system-skill-advisor.js`, `opencode-goal.js` | Selected hard cases, not the plugin list (that comes from `helpers/plugin-inventory.cjs`). Registration plus behavior cases on a stub v2 context: completion advisory logging, a denied write through `execute.before`, goal continuation queued through `session.prompt`, goal evidence and token usage from session events, plus advisor transform dedup cleared after compaction. |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelke