; the tail follow-up is closed.\",keyQuestions:[\"Which cold-start paths (daemon, embedder, first prompt of a session) can exceed the runtime'\\''s hook budget, and what removes the stall?\"],answeredQuestions:[],ruledOut:[\"Preload the model at daemon start instead of a keep-alive\",\"Engineer the p95 tail as an embedding regression\",\"Raise the 750 ms deadline to absorb a cold load\"],focusTrack:\"performance\",edgeCase:\"missing-dependency\",toolsUsed:[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],sourcesQueried:[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/embeddings/adapters/ollama.ts:125-149,343\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/embeddings/registry.ts:83\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/measured-2026-11-12.txt:3-45\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/spec.md:130,174\"],timestamp:ts,durationMs:360000,graphEvents};\nconst rows=[\n {type:\"finding\",id:\"f-iter002-001\",label:\"The Ollama adapter sends no keep_alive, so the model unloads after the five-minute default; the measured expiry is four minutes forty-nine seconds after the reading, and the next prompt then pays 271 to 277 ms against a 6.57 ms warm median.\",iteration:2,sources:[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/embeddings/adapters/ollama.ts:343\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/measured-2026-11-12.txt:12\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/measured-2026-11-12.txt:36\"]},\n {type:\"finding\",id:\"f-iter002-002\",label:\"A cold embed of 271 to 277 ms fits the planned 750 ms prompt deadline with about 475 ms of headroom, so it is a latency tax on one prompt after an idle gap, not a fail-open.\",iteration:2,sources:[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-